  "question": "Which restaurant is nearest along the route connecting MSU Extention Service, Brandon, MS to Hyatt Place Jackson/Ridgeland, Ridgeland, MS?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-90.01043 32.278481)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-90.145429 32.437008)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'restaurant'\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-90.01043 32.278481)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5)\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-90.01043 32.278481)',4326)::geography ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
